Usar BEM:

```text
.section--scheme-light
.section--scheme-dark
.section--scheme-color
.section--scheme-gradient
```

No usar nombres sueltos como:

```text
scheme-dark
dark-section
section-dark
```

---

# SECTION ALIGNMENT

Usar:

```text
.section--align-left
.section--align-center
.section--align-right
```

